          <h3 class="font-display text-xl text-brand-300 mb-2">vs. Online custom workrooms (Two Pages, Loom Decor, The Shade Store online)</h3>
          <p class="text-white/85 leading-relaxed text-sm">Custom-sized but you measure yourself. Fabric chosen from a phone screen — never matches in person. You install. If a panel hangs wrong, you ship it back. Lead time: similar.</p>
